    IDS_HINT_TEXT_10        "To keep the flag in sight on the taskbar, turn Lang Switcher on in Settings: Personalization → Taskbar → “Select which icons appear on the taskbar”. For now it is under the arrow ^."
    IDS_HINT_OPEN           "Open Windows Settings"
    IDS_MENU_WHATSNEW       "What’s new in {0}…"
    IDS_UPDATES_SWITCH      "Tell me about updates of the program"
